+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, development builds included, and this applies going forward. Local testing uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. The project also records an HTTPS-everywhere decision with no plaintext exception, since certificate management is now in place.
